<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net"><diagram id="01-compile-backend-panorama" name="torch.compile 全景：从 FX 到设备图"><mxGraphModel adaptiveColors="auto" grid="0" gridSize="8" page="0" background="#FFFFFF">
